Differences from the demucs command
  - "Standard" quality equals `demucs --shifts 0`. The command default is
    `--shifts 1` (one random shift). "Best" uses 2 shifts.
  - The browser decodes and resamples the file (decodeAudioData). The
    command uses ffmpeg and julius. For a 48 kHz file the stems can differ
    from the command by more than the engine error (see CONTRACT.md 2.6).
  - A track of 1 sample: upstream fails (std is NaN). The page gives a
    finite output.
